      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'As Count Down, you will embark on a perilous journey. Beginning with the
    highest number, each corrupted number must be defeated and erased. Only when
    a number has completely vanished does the path to the next one open, until, at
    last, the 1 is defeated.

    But beware! Every number defends itself with unique
    attacks and abilities. If Count Down succeeds in completing the countdown from
    9 to 1, balance can be restored to the Kingdom of Herzelnica.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 081c0cb3e46f8c448a1ba2f2d1ddc529, type: 2}
